      "id": "b0334",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ad8a7049d7c5511",
      "translationZh": "它",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0376",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2ad8a7049d7c5511",
      "translationZh": "它",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0396",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fdd02e9cd726657c",
      "translationZh": "秉承原始 Falcon 模型的理念，Falcon2-11B 不仅使用英语数据进行训练，还使用了另外十种语言的数据。我们的多语言评估结果表明，该模型在 Multilingual LLM Leaderboard 涵盖的六种语言（de、es、fr、it、nl、ro）上表现出良好的能力，而且在所有上述语言上的表现实际上都优于 Falcon-40B 和其他几个多语言模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0397",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b7ad8efb51f518ca",
      "translationZh": "我们很快将在 Falcon2-11B 模型卡中发布更全面的多语言能力评估结果！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0398",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "091c62d933a4409b",
      "translationZh": "代码生成能力",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0399",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "51a0dcd6e360192b",
      "translationZh": "我们参照 BigCode Leaderboard，在面向 Python 语言的 HumanEval 基准测试上检验了该模型的代码生成表现，得到的 pass@1 为 29.59%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0400",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b313e5265dc36f17",
      "translationZh": "使用 Falcon2-11B",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0401",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f596fedabc69df66",
      "translationZh": "然后，你可以使用如下代码来运行文本生成：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0402",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a6b72a802ea535fb",
      "translationZh": "Falcon2-11B 视觉语言模型",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0403",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b971e2ec49dda50",
      "translationZh": "Falcon2-11B VLM 是一个基于该大语言模型（LLM）构建的视觉语言模型（VLM），它还支持图像输入，能够回答有关图像的问题。为实现这一点，我们将预训练的 CLIP ViT-L/14 视觉编码器与经过聊天微调的 Falcon2-11B 模型相结合，并使用图像-文本数据进行训练。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0404",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d9cc5328ac69c267",
      "translationZh": "为了增强 VLM 对图像中小物体细粒度细节的感知能力，我们对图像输入采用了高分辨率动态编码机制，类似于 LLaVA-Next 的做法。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0405",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "36a798e3f39239cc",
      "translationZh": "训练",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0406",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0befedd1592b9a1",
      "translationZh": "训练分为两个阶段：预训练和微调。在这两个阶段中，视觉编码器的权重均保持冻结。在预训练阶段，LLM 保持冻结，仅使用 558K 个图像-描述对训练多模态投影器。这使多模态投影器能够学习从视觉嵌入空间到文本嵌入空间的映射。在微调阶段，投影器和 LLM 的权重均使用来自公开数据集、包含 1.2M 条图像-文本指令数据的语料进行训练，其中也包含多轮对话。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0407",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "36cd303e65f18182",
      "translationZh": "Falcon2-11B VLM 评估",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0408",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e2c614c23f02239",
      "translationZh": "模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0412",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f090c68571ca129b",
      "translationZh": "教皇",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0417",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b38ae2c5b84529e8",
      "translationZh": "平均值",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0458",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "82c9fea802215736",
      "translationZh": "使用 Falcon2-11B-FalconVLM",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0459",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fa629d591d1f4242",
      "translationZh": "许可信息",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0460",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6faa8ae464ebe2b4",
      "translationZh": "Falcon 2 模型依据 TII Falcon 2 License 提供，这是一项基于 Apache 2.0 的宽松软件许可证，其中包含一项旨在促进负责任地使用 AI 的可接受使用政策。该许可证的制定秉承了 TII 对开源社区的承诺精神。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
